WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.275
Let’s see Claso through one clear example.

00:00:03.275 --> 00:00:07.538
Follow an assignment from setting up a class to returning a result.

00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:13.008
The administrator sets up the mathematics class and assigns its teacher.

00:00:13.733 --> 00:00:16.958
Students are enrolled and the class is saved.

00:00:16.958 --> 00:00:19.646
Everyone now has a place to work.

00:00:20.433 --> 00:00:26.458
Inside the same class, the teacher prepares a linear equations assignment with clear instructions.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:32.125
Select publish, and that assignment appears for the students enrolled in the class.

00:00:32.867 --> 00:00:37.442
The student opens the assignment and writes a solution, showing each step.

00:00:38.167 --> 00:00:40.129
Select submit.

00:00:40.129 --> 00:00:43.742
The work is now a submission for the teacher to review.

00:00:44.533 --> 00:00:49.281
The teacher reviews the solution, adds feedback, and returns the result.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.262
The student can now read the published result and teacher feedback.

00:00:54.262 --> 00:00:57.412
The same assignment, from start to finish.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.112
This is Claso.

00:01:00.112 --> 00:01:03.212
Connected steps, with clear permissions.

00:01:03.212 --> 00:01:04.988
One School.

00:01:04.988 --> 00:01:06.862
One System.
